  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nThis solid and affordable single-level brick and block home offers warmth and comfort in winter, and a cool retreat during the summer months.\r\n\r\nOne of its biggest attractions is its location within the highly sought-after Rangitoto College School Zone.\r\n\r\nSet on a sunny, fully fenced section, the property also features a lovely vegetable garden, making it an ideal choice for families.\r\nThe home offers three good-sized bedrooms, plus an additional versatile room that could be used as a teenager's retreat, a second living area or a home office.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a fantastic location, just a short walk to Sherwood Reserve and Freyberg Park, with Browns Bay Beach also within easy reach.\r\nFamilies will appreciate the convenience of being within walking distance of Sherwood Primary School and Northcross Intermediate School.\r\n\r\nThe owner has already relocated to another city, and this property must be sold. Don't miss this opportunity to secure a fantastic home for your family.",
